Flight Check; 3) Cessna 172 General Visual Inspection (GVI); 4) Aviation Careers Exploration.  \n \nThis version is specifically designed for institutions that require a campus-wide implementation. It is secured with a passcode provided through Xennial\u2019s XR Platform.\n\n*** IMPORTANT NOTE:  A LICENSE IS REQUIRED TO ACCESS THIS APP AND CAN ONLY BE ACQUIRED DIRECTLY THROUGH XENNIAL OR ONE OF ITS DISTRIBUTION PARTNERS. \nTO LEARN MORE: XENNIAL@XENNIALDIGITAL.COM ***\n\n", "short_description": "Xennial\u2019s VR Intro to Aviation Program is a comprehensive training simulator with four essential modules for Schools of Aviation looking to provide critical tools for aircraft maintenance technicians. It includes four modules: 1) Cessna 172 Aircraft Familiarization; 2) Cessna 172 Pre-Flight Check 3) Cessna 172 General Visual Inspection (GVI); 4) Aviation Careers Exploration. This version is specifically designed for institutions that require a campus-wide implementation. \n"}]}, "developer_name": "Xennial", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.xennialdigital.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Xennial", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.xennialdigital.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8485988901431707"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseli